{"id": "en-r-8de5rt.en", "jokeId": "en-r-8de5rt", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Profanity dropped from the punchline for Shorts; the double meaning of 'see my girlfriend' carries it. The friend walks up and shows the wife's photo on his phone.", "title": "The Optician", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A man bumps into an old school friend on Main Street.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Well, well! Look at me now. Big job, big salary, a brand new sports car.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "And this is my wife. Beautiful, isn't she?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "If you think she's gorgeous, you should see my girlfriend.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Why? Is she a stunner?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "No. She's an optician.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-8de5rt.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-8de5rt", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Pun rebuilt per the note: 'кажется красавицей' → 'показаться моей девушке' (to see a doctor); punchline 'она окулист'. Profanity dropped.", "title": "Окулист", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Мужик встречает на улице бывшего одноклассника.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Смотри, как я поднялся! Должность, зарплата, спортивная машина.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "А это моя жена. Красавица, правда?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Если она тебе кажется красавицей, тебе надо показаться моей девушке.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "А что, она ещё красивее?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Нет. Она окулист.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-8de5rt.de", "jokeId": "en-r-8de5rt", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Pun rebuilt per the note: 'zu meiner Freundin gehen' (visit her as a doctor); optician became Augenärztin, which lands better in German. Profanity dropped.", "title": "Die Augenärztin", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Mann trifft auf der Hauptstraße einen alten Schulfreund.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Schau mich an! Toller Job, dickes Gehalt, ein nagelneuer Sportwagen.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Und das ist meine Frau. Wunderschön, oder?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wenn du die schön findest, solltest du mal zu meiner Freundin gehen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Warum? Ist die noch schöner?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Nein. Die ist Augenärztin.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "businessman"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-b3n4or.en", "jokeId": "en-r-b3n4or", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Two scenes: the cabin (blind pilots walk down the aisle, the passenger panics) and, after a wipe, the cockpit for the punchline. Co-pilot is the sluzhivy double, still a pilot. Added the pilot's 'Made it again' to show it is routine.", "title": "Blind Flight", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Two pilots board a plane. Both wear dark glasses and carry white canes.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wait. Are those our pilots?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The plane races down the runway, but it won't take off. The fence is getting closer.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "The fence! The fence! Pull up!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "At the last second, the plane lifts off. Meanwhile, in the cockpit...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Phew. Made it again.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "You know, one day they're going to scream too late, and we're all going to die.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "seat-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-right", "to": "aisle"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "from": "off-right", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "samolet", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-b3n4or.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-b3n4or", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Same two-scene staging as the English version: cabin, then the cockpit after a wipe. 'White sticks' → 'белые трости'.", "title": "Слепой рейс", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "В самолёт заходят два пилота. Оба в тёмных очках и с белыми тростями.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Погодите. Это что, наши пилоты?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Самолёт несётся по полосе, но не взлетает. Забор всё ближе.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Забор! Забор! Взлетай!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "В последнюю секунду самолёт отрывается от земли. А в кабине...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Фух. Опять пронесло.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Знаешь, когда-нибудь они закричат слишком поздно, и мы все разобьёмся.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "seat-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-right", "to": "aisle"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "from": "off-right", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "samolet", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-b3n4or.de", "jokeId": "en-r-b3n4or", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Same two-scene staging as the English version: cabin, then the cockpit after a wipe.", "title": "Blindflug", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Zwei Piloten steigen ins Flugzeug. Beide mit dunkler Brille und weißem Blindenstock.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Moment mal. Sind das etwa unsere Piloten?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Die Maschine rast über die Startbahn, hebt aber nicht ab. Der Zaun kommt immer näher.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Der Zaun! Der Zaun! Hochziehen!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "In letzter Sekunde hebt die Maschine ab. Und im Cockpit...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Puh. Wieder geschafft.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Weißt du, eines Tages schreien die zu spät, und dann sind wir alle tot.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "samolet", "cast": ["muzhik", "sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "seat-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-right", "to": "aisle"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "from": "off-right", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "samolet", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "pilot", "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "pilot"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
